d chaos  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two encounters play out the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/92865fdf6b5b46fe89608516d1b4cc97.poster.avif?t=1781228671\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/92865fdf6b5b46fe89608516d1b4cc97.webm?t=1781228671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/92865fdf6b5b46fe89608516d1b4cc97.mp4?t=1781228671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING, STORY-DRIVEN UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a dystopian universe enriched with cinematics and lore brought to life by real actors, giving depth to the story and its characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also find a unique shop where you can upgrade your equipment and prepare for your next missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/82bc058f50c17c22dc3b8d4d5560d0ee.poster.avif?t=1781228671\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/82bc058f50c17c22dc3b8d4d5560d0ee.webm?t=1781228671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756180/extras/82bc058f50c17c22dc3b8d4d5560d0ee.mp4?t=1781228671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGEROUS AND VARIED ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across multiple worlds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval cities  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen landscapes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burning 